l":"ggJ2O-z7enT_text","default":"<p><strong>- Robert M.</strong></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg04p0SBmm8_text","label":"gg04p0SBmm8_text","default":"<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong>\"T went from 254 ng/dl to 743 ng/dl in 14 weeks.\"</strong> - \"Before taking Wellness Nest gummies: Soft, low energy, clients were out-lifting me. After these gummies? My testosterone levels went nuclear. I f***ed my girlfriend on the weight bench after closing the gym - she was shaking and laughing. She forced me to take shirtless before/after pics because “no one will believe this is the same guy.” Half my clients are now ordering these because they want whatever the hell I’m on.\"</span></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggKUV0zAEjW_text","label":"ggKUV0zAEjW_text","default":"<p><strong>- Anthony W.</strong></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggkMdx-IE0o_text","label":"ggkMdx-IE0o_text","default":"<p><strong>“Threw away the coffee table full of powders and pills. Haven’t looked back.”</strong></p><p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">&nbsp;- </span>“I was easily at $215 a month on: flavored creatine packets, pre-workout scoops that tasted like candy, separate Maca + Tribulus libido boosters, daytime energy gummies, and night-time ZMA + GABA recovery capsules so my body could ‘reset.’</p><p>Even my kids noticed Dad was always ‘tired after work.’ Two weeks after switching to Wellness Nest those dead afternoons were gone. By week four I had natural, lasting energy for the gym, backyard games with the boys, and date nights — no jitters, no crash, no extra stuff.</p><p>One little pack replaced my whole coffee-table pharmacy. Feels like I finally found what actually works.”</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggaQ-qxPD7T_text","label":"ggaQ-qxPD7T_text","default":"<p><strong>- Daniel R.</strong></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggGZ2Obq8g4_text","label":"ggGZ2Obq8g4_text","default":"<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong>\"My wife thinks I'm 25 again.\"</strong> - \"I used to be the guy who was always overworked, stressed, sex drive completely dead - looked miserable in every pic. Trying these gummies for few weeks, I came home from work one day, picked my wife up like a caveman, and didn’t let her leave the bedroom for 90 minutes. She took the before/after photos while cracking up and said “Who kidnapped my husband and replaced him with this sex machine?” I’m never going back.</span></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggjVWzOyzo8_text","label":"ggjVWzOyzo8_text","default":"<p><strong>- Marcus D.</strong></p>"}],
